{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Erstelle eine universelle FAQ-Section für Produktseiten im DocMed-Shop, die über Metafelder mit bis zu 6 individuellen FAQs pro Produkt gefüllt werden kann.
    
    Die Section soll auf jeder Produktseite automatisch die jeweils hinterlegten FAQ-Inhalte des aktuellen Produkts anzeigen.
    
    Verwende dafür folgende Metafelder:
    
    FAQ 1 – Frage  
    FAQ 1 – Antwort
    
    FAQ 2 – Frage  
    FAQ 2 – Antwort
    
    FAQ 3 – Frage  
    FAQ 3 – Antwort
    
    FAQ 4 – Frage  
    FAQ 4 – Antwort
    
    FAQ 5 – Frage  
    FAQ 5 – Antwort
    
    FAQ 6 – Frage  
    FAQ 6 – Antwort
    
    Wichtig: Wenn bei einem Produkt einzelne FAQ-Felder leer sind, dürfen dafür keine leeren Accordion-Zeilen angezeigt werden. Sind beispielsweise nur 3 FAQs gepflegt, sollen auch nur diese 3 angezeigt werden.
    
    Wenn bei einem Produkt gar keine FAQ-Metafelder ausgefüllt sind, soll die gesamte FAQ-Section automatisch ausgeblendet werden.
    
    Die Section soll maximal 1500 px breit und mittig ausgerichtet sein.
    
    Oben sollen optional folgende Elemente angezeigt werden:
    
    Eyebrow:
    „IHRE FRAGEN – UNSERE ANTWORTEN“
    
    Überschrift:
    „Häufige Fragen zu diesem Produkt“
    
    Beschreibung:
    „Hier finden Sie Antworten auf häufige Fragen zu Anwendung, Eigenschaften, Kompatibilität, Lieferung und weiteren Produktdetails.“
    
    Diese Texte sollen im Theme Editor frei bearbeitet oder ausgeblendet werden können.
    
    Die FAQs sollen als Accordion dargestellt werden.
    
    Geschlossener Zustand:
    Frage links, Plus-Icon rechts.
    
    Geöffneter Zustand:
    Frage bleibt sichtbar, Plus-Icon wird zu einem Minus-Icon und die Antwort wird direkt darunter angezeigt.
    
    Auf Desktop sollen die FAQs bei 4–6 vorhandenen Einträgen auf zwei gleich breite Spalten verteilt werden. Bei einer ungeraden Anzahl soll die Verteilung automatisch möglichst gleichmäßig erfolgen.
    
    Beispiele:
    6 FAQs → 3 links / 3 rechts  
    5 FAQs → 3 links / 2 rechts  
    4 FAQs → 2 links / 2 rechts  
    3 oder weniger FAQs → optional einspaltig oder automatisch sinnvoll verteilen.
    
    Auf Mobile sollen alle FAQs immer einspaltig untereinander dargestellt werden.
    
    Die Section muss vollständig responsive sein.
    
    Im Theme Editor möchte ich folgende Einstellungen anpassen können:
    
    - maximale Breite bis 1500 px
    - Section-Padding oben und unten
    - seitliches Padding
    - Spaltenabstand
    - Abstand zwischen FAQ-Elementen
    - Hintergrundfarbe der Section
    - Hintergrundfarbe der FAQ-Karten
    - Farbe der Eyebrow
    - Farbe der Überschrift
    - Farbe der Beschreibung
    - Farbe der Fragen
    - Farbe der Antworten
    - Farbe der Plus-/Minus-Icons
    - Border-Farbe
    - aktive Border-Farbe
    - Hover-Farbe
    - Border Radius
    - Border-Stärke
    - Schatten
    - Schriftgrößen
    - Schriftstärken
    - Zeilenhöhen
    - separate Desktop- und Mobile-Schriftgrößen
    
    Zusätzlich soll einstellbar sein:
    
    - nur eine FAQ gleichzeitig geöffnet
    - mehrere FAQs gleichzeitig geöffnet
    - erstes FAQ beim Laden geöffnet
    - alle FAQs beim Laden geschlossen
    
    Die Section soll universell für alle Produktarten funktionieren und keinerlei produktspezifische Inhalte oder Icons fest enthalten.
    
    Standarddesign:
    Dunkelblau #1D2E40  
    Türkis #7FC7CF  
    Weiß bzw. sehr helles Blau als Hintergrund  
    neutrales Dunkelgrau für Sekundärtexte
    
    Alle Farben müssen im Theme Editor überschreibbar sein.
    
    Optional kann rechts oben zusätzlich eine kleine Service-Box stehen:
    
    „Noch Fragen?“  
    „Unser Kundenservice hilft Ihnen gerne weiter.“
    
    Auch diese Box soll ein- und ausblendbar sowie farblich vollständig anpassbar sein.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign faq_count = 0 %}
{% for i in (1..6) %}
  {% assign question_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_question' %}
  {% assign answer_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_answer' %}
  {% assign question_field = product.metafields.custom[question_key] %}
  {% assign answer_field = product.metafields.custom[answer_key] %}
  {% if question_field != blank and answer_field != blank %}{% assign faq_count = faq_count | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if faq_count > 0 %}
  {% style %}
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; background:{{ block.settings.section_bg }}; padding:{{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.side_padding }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__inner { width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:{{ block.settings.max_width }}px; margin:0 auto; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__header { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px; margin-bottom:24px; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__intro { flex:1; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__eyebrow { margin:0 0 10px; color:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }}; font-size:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_size_mobile }}px; font-weight:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_weight }}; line-height:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_line_height }}; letter-spacing:.08em; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__title { margin:0 0 12px; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-size:{{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px; font-weight:{{ block.settings.heading_weight }}; line-height:{{ block.settings.heading_line_height }}; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__description { margin:0; color:{{ block.settings.description_color }}; font-size:{{ block.settings.description_size_mobile }}px; line-height:{{ block.settings.description_line_height }}; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__service { flex:0 0 260px; padding:18px 20px; color:{{ block.settings.service_text_color }}; background:{{ block.settings.service_bg }}; border:{{ block.settings.border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px; box-shadow:{{ block.settings.shadow_x }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_y }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_color }}; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__service-title { margin:0 0 5px; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__service-text { margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); column-gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px; row-gap:{{ block.settings.item_gap }}px; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__item { min-width:0; border:{{ block.settings.border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px; background:{{ block.settings.card_bg }}; box-shadow:{{ block.settings.shadow_x }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_y }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_color }}; overflow:hidden; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__item:hover { border-color:{{ block.settings.hover_color }}; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__item[open] { border-color:{{ block.settings.active_border }}; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__item summary { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:18px 20px; color:{{ block.settings.question_color }}; font-size:{{ block.settings.question_size_mobile }}px; font-weight:{{ block.settings.question_weight }}; line-height:{{ block.settings.question_line_height }}; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__item summary:focus-visible { outline:3px solid {{ block.settings.hover_color }}; outline-offset:-3px; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__icon { position:relative; flex:0 0 20px; width:20px; height:20px; color:{{ block.settings.icon_color }}; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__icon:before,.dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__icon:after { content:''; position:absolute; left:3px; top:9px; width:14px; height:2px; background:currentColor; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__icon:after { transform:rotate(90deg); }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} details[open] .dm-faq__icon:after { display:none; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__answer { padding:0 20px 20px; color:{{ block.settings.answer_color }}; font-size:{{ block.settings.answer_size_mobile }}px; line-height:{{ block.settings.answer_line_height }}; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__answer p:first-child { margin-top:0; }
    .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__answer p:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }
    @media (min-width:750px) { .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__eyebrow { font-size:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_size_desktop }}px; } .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__title { font-size:{{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px; } .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__description { font-size:{{ block.settings.description_size_desktop }}px; } .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__item summary { font-size:{{ block.settings.question_size_desktop }}px; } .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__answer { font-size:{{ block.settings.answer_size_desktop }}px; } }
    @media (max-width:749px) { .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding-left:{{ block.settings.mobile_side_padding }}px; padding-right:{{ block.settings.mobile_side_padding }}px; } .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__header { display:block; } .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__service { margin-top:18px; } .dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dm-faq__grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  {% endstyle %}
  <section class="dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-single="{{ block.settings.single_open }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="dm-faq__inner">{% if block.settings.show_eyebrow or block.settings.show_heading or block.settings.show_description or block.settings.show_service %}<div class="dm-faq__header"><div class="dm-faq__intro">{% if block.settings.show_eyebrow and block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<p class="dm-faq__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_heading and block.settings.heading != blank %}<h2 class="dm-faq__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_description and block.settings.description != blank %}<p class="dm-faq__description">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p>{% endif %}</div>{% if block.settings.show_service %}<aside class="dm-faq__service"><h3 class="dm-faq__service-title">{{ block.settings.service_title | escape }}</h3><p class="dm-faq__service-text">{{ block.settings.service_text | escape }}</p></aside>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}<div class="dm-faq__grid">{% assign faq_index = 0 %}{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign question_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_question' %}{% assign answer_key = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_answer' %}{% assign question_field = product.metafields.custom[question_key] %}{% assign answer_field = product.metafields.custom[answer_key] %}{% if question_field != blank and answer_field != blank %}{% assign faq_index = faq_index | plus: 1 %}{% assign question_value = question_field.value | default: question_field %}{% assign answer_value = answer_field.value | default: answer_field %}<details class="dm-faq__item" data-faq-index="{{ faq_index }}" {% if block.settings.open_first and faq_index == 1 %}open{% endif %}><summary><span>{{ question_value | escape }}</span><span class="dm-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="dm-faq__answer">{{ answer_value | metafield_tag }}</div></details>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
  <script>(function(){var root=document.querySelector('.dm-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}');if(!root)return;var items=root.querySelectorAll('.dm-faq__item');if(root.dataset.single==='true'){items.forEach(function(item){item.addEventListener('toggle',function(){if(item.open){items.forEach(function(other){if(other!==item)other.open=false;});}});});}})();</script>
{% endif %}
{% schema %}
{"name":"Produkt-FAQ","settings":[{"type":"header","content":"Inhalte"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow anzeigen","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"IHRE FRAGEN – UNSERE ANTWORTEN"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_heading","label":"Überschrift anzeigen","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Überschrift","default":"Häufige Fragen zu diesem Produkt"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_description","label":"Beschreibung anzeigen","default":true},{"type":"textarea","id":"description","label":"Beschreibung","default":"Hier finden Sie Antworten auf häufige Fragen zu Anwendung, Eigenschaften, Kompatibilität, Lieferung und weiteren Produktdetails."},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_service","label":"Service-Box anzeigen","default":false},{"type":"text","id":"service_title","label":"Service-Titel","default":"Noch Fragen?"},{"type":"text","id":"service_text","label":"Service-Text","default":"Unser Kundenservice hilft Ihnen gerne weiter."},{"type":"header","content":"Layout"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"max_width","label":"Maximale Breite","min":600,"max":1500,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":1500},{"type":"range","id":"padding_top","label":"Padding oben","min":0,"max":120,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":60},{"type":"range","id":"padding_bottom","label":"Padding unten","min":0,"max":120,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":60},{"type":"range","id":"side_padding","label":"Seitliches Padding","min":0,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":25},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_side_padding","label":"Mobile Seitenabstand","min":0,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"range","id":"column_gap","label":"Spaltenabstand","min":8,"max":60,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":24},{"type":"range","id":"item_gap","label":"Abstand zwischen FAQs","min":4,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":14},{"type":"header","content":"Accordion"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"single_open","label":"Nur eine FAQ gleichzeitig öffnen","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"open_first","label":"Erste FAQ beim Laden öffnen","default":false},{"type":"header","content":"Farben"},{"type":"color","id":"section_bg","label":"Section-Hintergrund","default":"#F8FCFE"},{"type":"color","id":"card_bg","label":"Kartenhintergrund","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"color","id":"eyebrow_color","label":"Eyebrow","default":"#1D2E40"},{"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Überschrift","default":"#1D2E40"},{"type":"color","id":"description_color","label":"Beschreibung","default":"#4B5563"},{"type":"color","id":"question_color","label":"Fragen","default":"#1D2E40"},{"type":"color","id":"answer_color","label":"Antworten","default":"#374151"},{"type":"color","id":"icon_color","label":"Plus-/Minus-Icon","default":"#1D2E40"},{"type":"color","id":"border_color","label":"Rahmen","default":"#D7E3E8"},{"type":"color","id":"active_border","label":"Aktiver Rahmen","default":"#7FC7CF"},{"type":"color","id":"hover_color","label":"Hover","default":"#7FC7CF"},{"type":"color","id":"service_bg","label":"Service-Box Hintergrund","default":"#1D2E40"},{"type":"color","id":"service_text_color","label":"Service-Box Text","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"header","content":"Kartenstil"},{"type":"range","id":"radius","label":"Border Radius","min":0,"max":30,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":10},{"type":"range","id":"border_width","label":"Border-Stärke","min":0,"max":6,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":1},{"type":"range","id":"shadow_x","label":"Schatten horizontal","min":-10,"max":10,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":0},{"type":"range","id":"shadow_y","label":"Schatten vertikal","min":0,"max":20,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":4},{"type":"range","id":"shadow_blur","label":"Schatten Unschärfe","min":0,"max":30,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":0},{"type":"color","id":"shadow_color","label":"Schattenfarbe","default":"#DCE6EA"},{"type":"header","content":"Typografie"},{"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_size_desktop","label":"Eyebrow Desktop","min":10,"max":22,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":13},{"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_size_mobile","label":"Eyebrow Mobile","min":10,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":12},{"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_weight","label":"Eyebrow Schriftstärke","min":400,"max":800,"step":100,"default":600},{"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_line_height","label":"Eyebrow Zeilenhöhe","min":1,"max":2,"step":0.1,"default":1.4},{"type":"range","id":"heading_size_desktop","label":"Überschrift Desktop","min":22,"max":52,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":34},{"type":"range","id":"heading_size_mobile","label":"Überschrift Mobile","min":20,"max":36,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":26},{"type":"range","id":"heading_weight","label":"Überschrift Schriftstärke","min":400,"max":800,"step":100,"default":700},{"type":"range","id":"heading_line_height","label":"Überschrift Zeilenhöhe","min":1,"max":2,"step":0.1,"default":1.2},{"type":"range","id":"description_size_desktop","label":"Beschreibung Desktop","min":12,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"range","id":"description_size_mobile","label":"Beschreibung Mobile","min":12,"max":22,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15},{"type":"range","id":"description_line_height","label":"Beschreibung Zeilenhöhe","min":1,"max":2,"step":0.1,"default":1.6},{"type":"range","id":"question_size_desktop","label":"Frage Desktop","min":14,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":17},{"type":"range","id":"question_size_mobile","label":"Frage Mobile","min":14,"max":22,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"range","id":"question_weight","label":"Frage Schriftstärke","min":400,"max":800,"step":100,"default":600},{"type":"range","id":"question_line_height","label":"Frage Zeilenhöhe","min":1,"max":2,"step":0.1,"default":1.5},{"type":"range","id":"answer_size_desktop","label":"Antwort Desktop","min":12,"max":22,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15},{"type":"range","id":"answer_size_mobile","label":"Antwort Mobile","min":12,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15},{"type":"range","id":"answer_line_height","label":"Antwort Zeilenhöhe","min":1,"max":2,"step":0.1,"default":1.6}],"presets":[{"name":"Produkt-FAQ"}],"tag":null,"class":"docmed-product-faq"}
